    "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/diegueins680/tdf-app/issues/464",
    "number": 464,
    "state": "open",
    "locked": false,
    "title": "Preserve editorial event fields during provider refreshes",
    "user": {
      "login": "diegueins680",
      "id": 2753581,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI3NTM1ODE=",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2753581?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/diegueins680",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/diegueins680",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/diegueins680/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/diegueins680/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/diegueins680/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/diegueins680/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/diegueins680/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/diegueins680/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/diegueins680/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/diegueins680/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/diegueins680/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "Provider refreshes previously replaced canonical event fields and the entire metadata object, erasing editorial corrections. Imports now retain field ownership evidence, refresh unchanged fields, and permanently relinquish edited fields. Custom metadata and editorial artwork survive repeated refreshes, even if provider values later coincide. Legacy records without ownership evidence remain protected while their external references refresh.\n\nAn event persistence failure now fails its source run before absence reconciliation, instead of logging the error and reporting success. Buen Plan also rejects truncated inventories at its ten-page cap, using the shared pagination-completeness check. Based on #463; no new schema or source enablement is included.\n\nValidation: full Stack build and 3,541 Hspec examples passed (zero failures, six existing pending cases), including repeated refresh, rescheduling, independent title/price/artwork/custom metadata edits, coincidental value agreement, and legacy ownership protection. Specification inventory regenerated and checked.\n\nScope limits: this protects canonical event fields. Venue/artist profile ownership, broader event administration and resumable provider pagination remain separate work. Required checks and independent review still apply; no production rollout is claimed.\n",
